---
import ElfHero from "./sprites/ElfHero.astro";
import PortraitToggle from "./PortraitToggle.astro";
---
<section id="top" class="relative pt-24 pb-16 md:pt-28 md:pb-20 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <!-- pixel ground -->
  <div
    class="absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-10 pointer-events-none bg-[var(--color-forest)] border-t-4 border-[var(--color-moss)]"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <!-- floating snowflakes -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 8%; animation-delay: 0s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 22%; animation-delay: -3s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 38%; animation-delay: -6s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 55%; animation-delay: -2s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 71%; animation-delay: -5s;"></span>
    <span class="snowflake" style="left: 88%; animation-delay: -1.5s;"></span>
  </div>

  <div class="relative max-w-3xl mx-auto flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-0">
    <span class="chip" data-hero="chip">EST. 1823 • PARODY</span>
    <p
      class="font-pixel text-[10px] md:text-xs leading-relaxed tracking-[0.2em] text-[var(--color-leaf)] mt-4 max-w-sm text-pretty text-balance"
      data-hero="tagline"
    >
      PETE: People for Ethical Treatment of Elves
    </p>

    <div class="relative flex justify-center shrink-0 mt-6" data-hero="sprite">
      <div class="relative">
        <PortraitToggle
          class="relative w-32 md:w-40 lg:w-44"
          ariaLabel="A tired 8-bit elf in a green tunic. Hover or click to cheer him up."
          data-sprite-idle
        >
          <ElfHero />
        </PortraitToggle>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h1
      class="font-pixel text-2xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-[1.35] text-[var(--color-cream)] mt-6"
      aria-label="Elves Deserve Better."
      data-hero="title"
    >
      <span data-scramble class="inline-block whitespace-nowrap">Elves</span>
      <span data-scramble class="inline-block whitespace-nowrap">Deserve</span>
      <br />
      <span data-scramble class="inline-block whitespace-nowrap text-[var(--color-gold)]">Better.</span>
    </h1>
    <p
      class="font-retro text-xl md:text-2xl leading-snug text-[var(--color-cream)]/80 mt-5 max-w-xl mx-auto text-balance"
      data-hero="copy"
    >
      For 1,200 winters, they've toiled in fluorescent-lit workshops under a sugar-based wage
      system and a single, deeply narcissistic boss. It's time to listen.
    </p>
    <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mt-7" data-hero="ctas">
      <a href="#help" class="pixel-btn">Join The Movement</a>
      <a href="#crisis" class="pixel-btn pixel-btn-ghost">Learn The Truth</a>
    </div>
    <div class="mt-6 flex items-center justify-center gap-3 text-[var(--color-cream)]/60 font-retro text-base" data-hero="supporters">
      <span class="inline-block w-2 h-2 bg-[var(--color-leaf)] animate-pulse"></span>
      14,629 supporters this winter, and counting.
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .snowflake {
    position: absolute;
    top: -10%;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-cream);
    opacity: 0.6;
    animation: fall 10s linear infinite;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
  }
  @keyframes fall {
    to {
      transform: translateY(120vh);
    }
  }
</style>
